{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"x":0.81275720122924311,"w":0.0576131693522135,"t":"Test 4","y":0.10174418590380141,"h":0.013096803770750509},{"x":0.088241309485856192,"w":0.045739603042602536,"h":0.012579192261533034,"t":"ANNIE:","y":0.1477801712868525,"c":1},{"t":"JACK:","w":0.039094651540120443,"x":0.088477365497187418,"y":0.19186046497758713,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.14491969703908603,"c":1,"h":0.016327025612335788,"x":0.17688015467543361,"t":"What about splitting it into two? You could investigate 19th- and 20th-","w":0.51660624186197912},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.17901235249287265,"y":0.16133720918203509,"t":"century fridges, and I'Il concentrate on what's available these days, and how","w":0.56584360758463548},{"x":0.1810699738778907,"t":"manufacturers differentiate their products from those of their competitors.","y":0.17432273252615005,"w":0.54115224202473955,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"w":0.14249661763509114,"t":"OK, that'd suit me.","x":0.17877684752042738,"h":0.014129145546992961,"y":0.18952597840014129,"c":1},{"h":0.014655134562749694,"x":0.090516941179563493,"c":1,"t":"PART 4","w":0.096743895212809239,"y":0.2368584792142312},{"c":1,"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"Hi everyone, in this session I'Il be presenting my research about the social history of Britain","x":0.088477356104371463,"w":0.67695475260416671,"y":0.26295641951052318},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.090534973986935371,"y":0.27761627896336272,"t":"during the Industrial Revolution. I particularly looked at how ordinary lives were affected","w":0.64609054565429691,"c":1},{"x":0.090534973033223456,"t":"by changes that happened at that time. This was a time that saw the beginning of a new","y":0.29210836302567755,"w":0.65226338704427089,"h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1},{"h":0.015261572578349258,"t":"phenomenon: consumerism - where buying and selling goods became a major part of","x":0.090480561218633349,"c":1,"w":0.6400229899088542,"y":0.30521333888956625},{"c":1,"t":"ordinary people's lives.","w":0.17695472717285154,"y":0.32122093008962516,"x":0.088477368805287948,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"c":1,"y":0.34302325568110204,"t":"In fact, it was in the 19th century that the quantity and quality of people's possessions was","h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.67078191121419262,"x":0.088477357046908012},{"y":0.35603816781764697,"x":0.090494947991610675,"t":"used as an indication of the wealth of the country. Before this, the vast majority of people had","c":1,"h":0.014563320101500965,"w":0.68939341227213546},{"t":"very few possessions, but all that was changed by the Industrial Revolution. This was the era","y":0.3701672096087425,"x":0.090484155933781479,"w":0.68940572102864583,"h":0.014649823641468052,"c":1},{"x":0.090488902734531584,"y":0.38483820878481345,"w":0.67911015828450516,"h":0.014816799770395739,"c":1,"t":"from the mid-18th to the late 19th century, when improvements in how goods were made as"},{"w":0.66473531087239579,"t":"well as in technology triggered massive social changes that transformed life for just about","x":0.090473815302922325,"c":1,"h":0.015268695368502838,"y":0.39889544172337366},{"y":0.43540270925108104,"h":0.015911707187288737,"w":0.67707255045572923,"c":1,"t":"First let's look at manufacturing. When it comes to manufacturing, we tend to think of the","x":0.092538447818774419},{"h":0.014669134142261342,"x":0.090483092293961634,"c":1,"t":"Industrial Revolution in images of steam engines and coal. And it's true that the Industrial","w":0.68324259440104163,"y":0.45000736435217759},{"h":0.014876227496790739,"x":0.092530603465598438,"y":0.46420071295243259,"t":"Revolution couldn't have taken place at all if it weren't for these new sources of power.","c":1,"w":0.66060724894205736},{"y":0.47952264067052952,"c":1,"t":"They marked an important shift away from the traditional watermills and windmills that","h":0.013892124903918113,"w":0.65852986653645829,"x":0.092550578460864827},{"h":0.016245066908981309,"x":0.088427810616147726,"t":"had dominated before this. The most advanced industry for much of the 19th century was","y":0.49369576809965765,"w":0.68735427856445319,"c":1},{"h":0.016463477985036112,"w":0.6688534545898438,"x":0.090476473205660574,"y":0.50793571558262096,"t":"textiles. This meant that fashionable fabrics, and lace and ribbons were made available","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.1012448755900065,"h":0.012523375916677515,"t":"to everyone.","y":0.52529653166858559,"x":0.088229826334393663},{"y":0.54505300372461074,"x":0.092592588875662893,"w":0.69135803222656245,"h":0.013086531271782831,"c":1,"t":"Before the Industrial Revolution, most people made goods to sell in small workshops, often in"},{"t":"their own homes. But enormous new machines were now being created that could produce","x":0.09053496926978899,"w":0.67695475260416671,"y":0.55948174315993571,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"t":"the goods faster and on a larger scale, and these required a lot more space. So large","x":0.090485071986594501,"w":0.63180908203124997,"h":0.014788714679587756,"y":0.57342238020052083,"c":1},{"x":0.090534970431602579,"t":"factories were built, replacing the workshops, and forcing workers to travel to work. In fact,","h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.67078191121419262,"y":0.58863368665781157,"c":1},{"y":0.60306242665565679,"c":1,"t":"large numbers of people migrated from villages into towns as a result.","w":0.51851852416992172,"x":0.090534976494462904,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.35610465100163236,"t":"Q31","x":0.81481481521622467,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q32","c":1,"x":0.81481481542521828,"w":0.037037035624186143,"y":0.39970930216442302},{"c":1,"t":"Q33","y":0.46511627892893803,"w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.81687242837766161},{"t":"Q34","x":0.81687242837766161,"y":0.5087209300917287,"w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"t":"Q35","w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"x":0.81687242865415344,"h":0.013081394460653373,"y":0.55813953516429538},{"x":0.090534983121981064,"h":0.01309166752126667,"w":0.64197530110677081,"t":"As well as manufacturing, there were new technologies in transport, contributing to the","c":1,"y":0.64680232546097294},{"w":0.68930043538411456,"c":1,"y":0.66133720918270211,"x":0.090534967395781887,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"growth of consumerism. The horse-drawn stagecoaches and carts of the 18th century, which"},{"w":0.66872426350911462,"x":0.092592600652161919,"t":"carried very few people and goods, and travelled slowly along poorly surfaced roads, were","h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"y":0.67579505310608123},{"x":0.09053498748809545,"c":1,"t":"gradually replaced by the numerous canals that were constructed. These were particularly","y":0.69040697663782447,"w":0.66872426350911462,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"x":0.09259259492449616,"w":0.65432098388671878,"h":0.014548579711374909,"c":1,"y":0.70347467621704396,"t":"important for the transportation of goods. The canals gradually fell out of use, though, as"},{"y":0.71776616249782044,"h":0.01527466116861409,"w":0.68734756469726566,"c":1,"t":"railways were developed, becoming the main way of moving goods and people from one end","x":0.092548238478248099},{"y":0.7325581394067805,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.092592581909075974,"c":1,"t":"of the country to the other. And the goods they moved weren't just coal, iron, clothes, and so","w":0.68312759399414069},{"h":0.014479613556878768,"x":0.092533040973310679,"t":"on - significantly, they included newspapers, which meant that thousands of people were not","y":0.74669441950241711,"c":1,"w":0.68942311604817708},{"w":0.68518519083658846,"x":0.090534976627257041,"y":0.76148409915696325,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"only more knowledgeable about what was going on in the country, but could also read about","c":1},{"y":0.77579806299879883,"x":0.092545689650095256,"c":1,"t":"what was available in the shops. And that encouraged them to buy more. So faster forms of","h":0.014761386125472509,"w":0.67911911010742188},{"w":0.6688336181640625,"t":"transport resulted in distribution becoming far more efficient - goods could now be sold all","y":0.79016415025584896,"h":0.015013110651705852,"c":1,"x":0.090491595869414618},{"t":"over the country, instead of just in the local market.","y":0.80668604637660812,"h":0.014574259835502756,"x":0.09053497634952587,"w":0.38065844217936196,"c":1},{"t":"Q36","x":0.81687242858708387,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.74709302311498449,"w":0.037037035624186032,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.80377907004801619,"x":0.81687242884428557,"c":1,"t":"Q37","h":0.013081394460653484},{"t":"117","x":0.83950617307307485,"y":0.92005813935192304,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.032921810150146502}]}